6. Trademarks and film names
Film and manufacturer names such as Kodak, Fujifilm, Ilford, Harman, Kentmere, Agfa, Lomography,
CineStill, Polaroid, Rollei, Foma, Adox, Konica, ORWO, Bergger, Ferrania and JCH, as well as Adobe,
