information and are not guaranteed to match the color or grain of the actual films.

7. Privacy
The Software does not connect to the internet and does not collect or transmit photos or personal
information. Edit settings, presets and logs are stored only on your Mac
(~/Library/Application Support/Chiyo Film, ~/Library/Logs/Chiyo Film). A "problem report file" is
shared only when you send it yourself, and it contains no photos.

8. Changes and termination
The developer may change the Software and these terms, or stop distributing it, without notice.
Changed terms come with the new version, and installing a new version means you agree to them. If
